   "text": "EA Sports FC 27 is a solid football video game. It has a brand new mode in The Grounds, along with meaningful tweaks to the transfer system in career mode, and gameplay tweaks that do feel positive on the whole.\nSome of those tweaks make FC 27 play quite different in some ways, but some of those can feel a bit frustrating, as trying to fix certain issues seem to have caused others. For example fix",
